    "detailed_description": "<strong>CONTROLS</strong><br><i>Mouse - Tap &amp; Drag               <br>Keyboard - WASD / Space / ESC         </i>     <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496640/extras/d9adc3dc8f8603f5a0ad0f4a9f00552b.poster.avif?t=1742255290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496640/extras/d9adc3dc8f8603f5a0ad0f4a9f00552b.webm?t=1742255290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496640/extras/d9adc3dc8f8603f5a0ad0f4a9f00552b.mp4?t=1742255290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Satisfy your customers by enriching their food with your nutritious &amp; delicious futanari sauce!<br><br>Futanari di Funghi is a lewd waitressing game, bringing in extra flavour with interactive sauce pouring sections and light visual novel elements.<br>Featuring lewd scenes illustrated in stylized pixel art.<br><br>Every meal in this exquisite ristorante needs its special sauce topping.<br>If you empty up the whole jar mid-shift, our waitress Pipina will have to provide her very own sauce to fill it up again on the spot.<br><br>By inserting a magical mushroom from the land of the Funghi, Pipina is able to grow a stunningly sauce-packed shroom-like member of her own.<br>Squeeze out as much as you can and keep the orders coming!<br><br>At times it may be a demanding job for her, but seeing the smiles of her grateful guests makes it all worthwhile!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496640/extras/32eaff7cc2052e15f6b12575916ea284.poster.avif?t=1742255290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496640/extras/32eaff7cc2052e15f6b12575916ea284.webm?t=1742255290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496640/extras/32eaff7cc2052e15f6b12575916ea284.mp4?t=1742255290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>FEATURES:</strong><br><strong><i>-Unlock animations of fantastic Futanari Funghi<br>-Serving food against the clock, with a combo-based scoring system<br>-Crisp and sexy pixel art<br>-Player controlled lewd animations, essential for replenishing the most needed in-game resource<br>-Gallery Mode: For when you need to take 5<br>-Fun &amp; lighthearted sub-story<br>-Milk your sause and keep up with demand while still satisfying the customers!<br>-Funiculi Funicula</i></strong>",
